<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>TV-Blind third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { background: #111; color: #eee; } pre { background: #222; } a { color: #9cf; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>TV-Blind third-party licenses</h1>
<p>TV-Blind is made from the open-source components below. Each heading is a license, followed by the components that use it and the full license text.</p>
<p>TV-Blind itself is under the MIT License. Source code for TV-Blind and for Prism (MPL-2.0) is available at <a href="https://github.com/garo-pro/tvb">github.com/garo-pro/tvb</a> and <a href="https://github.com/garo-pro/prism2rust">github.com/garo-pro/prism2rust</a>.</p>

<h2>Summary</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li>{{name}}: {{count}} components</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

{{#each licenses}}
<section>
<h2 id="license-{{@index}}">{{name}}</h2>
<h3>Used by</h3>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
  <li>{{#if crate.repository}}<a href="{{crate.repository}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a>{{else}}{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{/if}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h3>License text</h3>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
